---
source: tests/render.rs
expression: "draw(&state, 80, 24)"
---
┌Help──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│Keys — navigation and modes                                                   │
│j/k or ↑/↓: move; g/G: first/last.                                            │
│h/l or za: collapse/expand session in grouped mode.                           │
│/: filter; text edits query; Backspace deletes; Esc returns to navigation and │
│retains query.                                                                │
│Enter: jump; Ctrl-z: zoom then jump.                                          │
│Ctrl-s: send line; x: kill; n: create.                                        │
│Ctrl-u/Ctrl-d: inspect preview half-page up/down; Ctrl-r: follow bottom.      │
│s: grouped/flat; ?: help; navigation q/Esc: close popup.                      │
│Send: text/Backspace, Enter send, Esc cancel.                                 │
│Kill: y/Y confirm; any other key cancels, except inert ?.                     │
│Create choice: j/k or ↑/↓, Enter, Esc.                                        │
│Create form: text/Backspace, Tab/↓ and Shift-Tab/↑, Enter, Esc.               │
│Locked create submission: q/Esc closes the popup; all other keys are inert.   │
│Six statuses and glyphs                                                       │
│● needs_input: waiting for a permission or question response.                 │
│◐ working: busy or retrying.                                                  │
│○ idle: known idle.                                                           │
│✗ error: agent error latched until work/user activity clears it.              │
│? unknown: no companion-plugin status is available.                           │
│⊘ stale: plugin heartbeat exceeded the configured stale threshold.            │
│j/k scroll | Ctrl-u/d half | PgUp/Dn page | g/G ends | ?, Esc, q close | 1/21 │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
